msgid ""
"Signals address the same broad goal - loosely coupled, in-process communication between application components - as two other mechanisms commonly used in Quarkus applications: https://jakarta.ee/specifications/cdi/4.1/jakarta-cdi-spec-4.1#events[CDI events] and the https://vertx.io/docs/vertx-core/java/#event_bus[Vert.x EventBus].\n"
