#, fuzzy
msgid "Reach for *Signals* as the default choice for loosely coupled, in-process asynchronous communication: they combine the compile-time type safety of CDI events with the flexible emission modes of the Vert.x EventBus, and add a Quarkus-idiomatic execution model on top. Signals are a particularly good fit when you need more than plain publish/subscribe (unicast or request-reply), want receivers that integrate naturally with reactive pipelines and virtual threads, or benefit from having both a declarative (`@Receives`) and a programmatic receiver API."
msgstr "将 *Signals* 作为松耦合、进程内异步通信的首选方案：它结合了 CDI 事件的编译时类型安全性和 Vert.x EventBus 的灵活发布模式，并在其基础上添加了符合 Quarkus 风格的执行模型。 当您需要超越简单的发布/订阅（单播或请求-响应）模式，希望接收器能与响应式管道和虚拟线程自然集成，或者希望同时利用声明式（ `@Receives` ）和编程式接收器 API 的优势时，Signals 尤为适用。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Use *CDI events* for simple publish/subscribe notifications between components, especially when you need synchronous delivery, transactional observers, or ordering of observers, or when you need to stay with the standard Jakarta EE API."
msgstr "在组件之间进行简单的发布/订阅通知时，请使用 *CDI 事件* ，特别是在需要同步传递、事务性观察者或观察者排序时，或者需要遵循标准 Jakarta EE API 时。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Use the *Vert.x EventBus* when you need to interact with the underlying Vert.x runtime directly or integrate with existing Vert.x components."
msgstr "当需要直接与底层的 Vert.x 运行时进行交互，或与现有的 Vert.x 组件集成时，请使用 *Vert.x EventBus* 。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "SPI"
msgstr "SPI"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `io.quarkus.signals.spi` package provides extension points for integrators.\n"
"Both `SignalMetadataEnricher` and `ReceiverInterceptor` implementations must be CDI beans annotated with `@io.smallrye.common.annotation.Identifier` to define a unique identifier."
msgstr "`io.quarkus.signals.spi` 包为集成者提供了扩展点。 `SignalMetadataEnricher` 和 `ReceiverInterceptor` 实现都必须是使用 `@io.smallrye.common.annotation.Identifier` 进行注解的 CDI Bean，以定义唯一标识符。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Signal Metadata Enricher"
msgstr "信号元数据丰富器"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A `SignalMetadataEnricher` enriches the metadata of a signal emission _before_ any receiver is invoked.\n"
"It is called once per emission (i.e., per call to `publish()`, `send()`, or `request()`), not per receiver, and is executed synchronously on the thread that emits the signal."
msgstr "`SignalMetadataEnricher` _在_ 调用任何接收器 _之前，_ 会对信号发射的元数据进行丰富处理。它每发射一次信号（即每次调用 `publish()` 、 `send()` 或 `request()` 时）被调用一次，而非按接收器调用，并且在发射信号的线程上同步执行。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `EnrichmentContext` provides access to the `SignalContext` and a `putMetadata()` method.\n"
"An `IllegalArgumentException` is thrown if a metadata entry with the given key already exists."
msgstr "`EnrichmentContext` 提供对 `SignalContext` 和 `putMetadata()` 方法的访问。如果给定键值的元数据条目已经存在，则会抛出 `IllegalArgumentException 异常` 。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Receiver Interceptor"
msgstr "接收器拦截器"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A `ReceiverInterceptor` intercepts each receiver invocation.\n"
"For multicast emissions (`publish`), it is called once per matching receiver.\n"
"The interceptor must call `proceed()` to continue the interceptor chain and eventually invoke the receiver.\n"
"It may transform the result, handle errors, or skip the invocation entirely by returning a different `Uni`."
msgstr "`ReceiverInterceptor` 会拦截每个接收器的调用。对于多播发射 `（发布` ），每个匹配的接收器都会被调用一次。拦截器必须调用 `proceed()` 继续拦截链，并最终调用接收器。它可以转换结果、处理错误，或通过返回不同的 `Uni` 来完全跳过调用。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Component Ordering"
msgstr "元件订购"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The ordering of enrichers and interceptors relative to each other can be defined with the `@RelativeOrder` annotation.\n"
"Components are referenced by their `@Identifier` value."
msgstr "可以使用 `@RelativeOrder` 注解来定义浓缩器和拦截器的相对排序。组件通过其 `@Identifier` 值进行引用。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "The `correlation-id` enricher runs _before_ the `timestamp` enricher."
msgstr "`相关标识` 富集器 _在_ `时间戳` 富集器 _之前_ 运行。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Cycles in the ordering are detected at build time and result in a deployment error."
msgstr "在构建时会检测到排序中的循环，并导致部署错误。"

msgid "Configuration Reference"
msgstr "配置参考"

